        "notes": "The game features violence (no dismemberment), stylised depictions of blood/skulls/corpses, occasional swearing, and textual references to cannibalism and drug use. Coca leaves are depicted as an (unusable) currency item. It also includes references to religion, sexuality, discrimination, and mental disorders. Game mechanics do not prevent the player character from attacking and killing non-combatants if they chose to do so."
